### scanBlockScalar(style)

```
folded = (style === '>')
chunks = []; start = getMark(); forward()
[chomping, increment] = scanBlockScalarIndicators(start)   // chomping: true(+) / false(-) / null
scanBlockScalarIgnoredLine(start)
